Someone else mentioned unicorn horns as a solution to the problem of
eating zombies.  Another option is the blessed tinning kit.  (Actually
maybe uncursed would work too, I don't know - but you're a priest
anyway, why not bless it?)  The blessed tins do not make you sick.  An
added benefit (depending on how you look at it) is that, if I'm not
mistaken, the nutritional value of the tin is not the same as that of
the corpse.  So, for instance, one can eat several tins of giant meat
(from giant zombies) in a row.

However, this still does not solve the problem of food.  Leave behind all
the gems you collected from the Gnomish Mines and stock up on food...

